flowchart TD
    Human[Human Operator] --> Kernel[K.E.R.N.E.L. / OpenClaw]
    Kernel --> Docs[Documentation and Runbooks]
    Kernel --> PVE[Proxmox Virtualization Layer]
    Kernel --> WARPi[WARPi Field Platform]

    subgraph Mgmt[Management / Recovery LAN]
        OpenClaw[OpenClaw / K.E.R.N.E.L. Node]
        DNS[AdGuard DNS / dns01]
        Guardian[Guardian SIEM / Wazuh]
        OpenWrt[OpenWrt Lab Router]
    end

    PVE --> Mgmt

    subgraph Core[Always-On Core Services]
        Holocron[Holocron Private UI]
        Tickets[GLPI Ticketing]
    end

    subgraph Routed[OpenWrt Routed Lab Segments]
        PentestSeg[Pentest Segment\n10.66.x.x family]
        SecuritySeg[Security Segment\n10.66.x.x family]
        ServicesSeg[Services Segment\n10.66.x.x family]
        AILabSeg[AI / Lab Segment\n10.66.x.x family]
        TriageSeg[Triage Segment\n10.66.x.x family]
    end

    subgraph OnDemand[On-Demand Workloads]
        Mission[Mission Control Backend]
        DERP[DERP AI Security Target]
        LabAI[AI Lab VM]
        BayDispatch[Workflow Automation VM]
        MalTriage[Malware Triage VM]
        Pentest[Kali / Pentest VM]
    end

    OpenWrt --> Routed
    Routed --> Core
    Routed --> OnDemand

    DNS -. advertised resolver .-> Routed
    OpenWrt -. blocks direct DNS bypass .-> Routed

    OpenWrt -. syslog and firewall events .-> Guardian
    Kernel -. sanitized Proxmox telemetry .-> Guardian
    Guardian -. local sensor only, no full bridge mirror .-> Mgmt

    Holocron --> Tickets
    Holocron --> OpenClaw

    Tailscale[Tailscale Private Overlay\nwhere approved] -. private access .-> Core
    Tailscale -. private management .-> OnDemand

    WARPi --> Field[Field Mode / Approved Security Wrappers]
    WARPi --> Mission

    DERP -. isolated training target .-> AILabSeg
    Pentest --> PentestSeg
    MalTriage --> TriageSeg

    Docs --> PublicRepo[Public GitHub Docs]
